%% MUPP-058 Install tip in Secret Santa mails
%% From a Secret Santa mail to the tip in it.
flowchart TD
    A[A card sends mail 1, 3 or 8 from lib/santa-mail.ts] --> B[The mail has installTip: true R1]
    B --> C[sendMail passes it to layout]
    C --> D[layout adds the tip after the button and the line about not answering: HTML with a numbered list, plain text numbered 1 to 3]
    E[Mail 2, 4, 5, 6 or 7] --> F[No installTip, no tip R1]
